  "sourceTitle": "Balsamic Marinated Chicken",
  "sourceText": "Balsamic Marinated Chicken\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Saturday, December 26, 2009 - 11:30pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1/4 cup balsamic vinegar\n1/4 cup honey\n1/4 cup olive oil\n2 tablespoons fresh rosemary chopped\n3 pounds chicken pieces\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix and and seal in a ziplock bag. Marinate chicken in refrigerate at least 2 hours. Put into lightly greased 13X9 baking pan. Bake at 375 for 45 minutes, basting often.",
